{"step_index":1126,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:33:50Z","thinking":"**Deducing graph radius bound**\n\nIf every vertex is either equal to a reference vertex `u` or adjacent to it, the ball of radius 1 centered at `u` encompasses the entire vertex set. This directly implies the graph's radius is at most 1, based on established properties of `minUpTo_le` and `radius_le_eccentricity`. Now, formalizing the lemma aims to capture this observation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' >> /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/test_weight2.lean\\n\\nlemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\\n    minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\\n  unfold minUpTo\\n  have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\\n    exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\\n  have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\\n  generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\\n  rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\\n  cases m with\\n  | top => contradiction\\n  | coe val =>\\n    simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\\n    exact hmin\\n\\ntheorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) :\\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.eccentricity G v := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.radius\\n  have hmem : GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ∈ Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ := by\\n    apply Finset.mem_image_of_mem\\n    exact Finset.mem_univ v\\n  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hmem\\n  rw [hb]\\n  have hle : (Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ).min ≤ ↑(GraphCalc.eccentricity G v) :=\\n    Finset.min_le hmem\\n  rw [hb] at hle\\n  exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp hle\\n\\nlemma radius_le_one_of_adj_all {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (hnt : GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G) (u : V)\\n    (h : ∀ w : V, w = u ∨ G.Adj u w) :\\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ 1 := by\\n  have h1 : ballWithin G 1 u = Finset.univ := ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all G u h\\n  unfold GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass at hnt\\n  unfold GraphCalc.order at hnt\\n  have h_card_ge : 1 ≤ Fintype.card V := by omega\\n  have hecc : GraphCalc.eccentricity G u ≤ 1 := by\\n    unfold GraphCalc.eccentricity\\n    exact minUpTo_le 1 h_card_ge h1\\n  have hrad := radius_le_eccentricity G u\\n  omega\\n\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_weight2.lean\\n\"","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"20000","toolAction":"\"Testing radius_le_one_of_adj_all\"","toolSummary":"\"Check test_weight2.lean with radius_le_one_of_adj_all\""}}]}
{"step_index":1127,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:33:54Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:33:54+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/task-1127\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' >> /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/test_weight2.lean\n\nlemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\n    minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\n  unfold minUpTo\n  have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\n    exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\n  have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\n  generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\n  rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\n  cases m with\n  | top => contradiction\n  | coe val =>\n    simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\n    exact hmin\n\ntheorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) :\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.eccentricity G v := by\n  unfold GraphCalc.radius\n  have hmem : GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ∈ Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ := by\n    apply Finset.mem_image_of_mem\n    exact Finset.mem_univ v\n  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hmem\n  rw [hb]\n  have hle : (Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ).min ≤ ↑(GraphCalc.eccentricity G v) :=\n    Finset.min_le hmem\n  rw [hb] at hle\n  exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mp hle\n\nlemma radius_le_one_of_adj_all {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (hnt : GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G) (u : V)\n    (h : ∀ w : V, w = u ∨ G.Adj u w) :\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ 1 := by\n  have h1 : ballWithin G 1 u = Finset.univ := ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all G u h\n  unfold GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass at hnt\n  unfold GraphCalc.order at hnt\n  have h_card_ge : 1 ≤ Fintype.card V := by omega\n  have hecc : GraphCalc.eccentricity G u ≤ 1 := by\n    unfold GraphCalc.eccentricity\n    exact minUpTo_le 1 h_card_ge h1\n  have hrad := radius_le_eccentricity G u\n  omega\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_weight2.lean\n\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/.system_generated/tasks/task-1127.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
